Z||000000||Tweek||06-03-2001||03:30 PM||||A few pics can be seen at <BR> <A HREF="http://www.jag-lovers.org/snaps/snap_view.php3?id=964456082" TARGET=_blank>http://www.jag-lovers.org/snaps/snap_view.php3?id=964456082</A>  The car does run, but needs a bit of restorative work. Interior needs help as the previous owner started to take some things apart with hopes of restoring. Electrical need some attention, as far as mechanical, at least needs 2 fuel pumps and a brake m/c. Would be great for parts or a fun project. I simply don't have the space and I need a little $$. Was asking about $600 or so.<P>Feel free to email me tedmckeen@msn.com as this is somewhat unrelated to Fieros...   Also I can take more pics if your really serious..  the car is about a 30 min drive away at my paents house right now. It will definatly need to be trailered away.||||reg||1
