Z||000011||Tweek||06-06-2001||02:37 PM||||I put up a bunch more pics I took the other day..   you can see em at: <A HREF="http://www.oswg.net/Ted/Jag/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.oswg.net/Ted/Jag/</A> <P><BR>I've never been a big fan of lumping, but I respect the guys that do it. One things for sure, it makes it a bit easier to find parts for your motor.<P>BTW I also found a guy near me that wants to buy it and put the body on a 4x4 apparently. He dont care bout the drivetrain at all.. So I may keep that, but im not sure how serious he is. But anyways Im gonna spend some time researching tonight to make sure that the tranny are compatible. Im assuming yours is an auto, most are.||||reg||1
