Z||000013||Tweek||06-06-2001||03:47 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Steve Normington:<BR><B> Changing OE on a British = Lumping = Bad<BR>Changing OE on a Asian Import = Ricing = Bad<BR>Changing OE on a American = Upgrading = Good<P>Why is that?<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I think cause most of us are "Americans" and we can do whatever we want. ||||reg||1
